    Coo --> FN2 & FN3
    Coo --> DC1 & DC2
    Coo --> SA4

    %% ── DIRECTOR ──
    Dir --> SC5 & SC6
    Dir --> SP1 & SP2 & SP3
    Dir --> FN4 & FN5
